# Innospots 示例服务部署清单（deploy.sh 读取）
# 格式: <slug> <tar.gz 内根目录名/artifactId> <健康检查 URL> <startup.sh profile>
#
# 制品路径: innospots-nexus-sample/dist/<package>.tar.gz
#
spring-app        innospots-nexus-sample-spring-app        http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health prod
spring-portal     innospots-nexus-sample-spring-portal     http://127.0.0.1:8081/actuator/health prod
spring-platform   innospots-nexus-sample-spring-platform   http://127.0.0.1:8082/openapi/specs local
